      "figureNone": "The item checks a symbolic quotient and remainder; a figure would not clarify the algorithm.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "latex": "\\frac{4x^3}{2x}=2x^2",
          "explain": "Divide the leading terms to get the first quotient term."
        },
        {
          "latex": "(2x-1)(2x^2)=4x^3-2x^2",
          "explain": "Multiply the divisor by the first quotient term."
        },
        {
          "latex": "4x^3+4x^2-7x+5-(4x^3-2x^2)=6x^2-7x+5",
          "explain": "Subtract the entire product from the current dividend."
        },
        {
          "latex": "\\frac{6x^2}{2x}=3x",
          "explain": "Divide the new leading terms for the next quotient term."
        },
        {
